# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Environment credentials — DELIBERATELY NOT IGNORED.
#
# .env.dev / .env.qa / .env.uat / .env.prod are committed on purpose, matching
# the convention already used by the sibling Octane platform: one file per
# environment, versioned so a new machine is reproducible without out-of-band
# setup. Do not add them to this file.
#
# The reference below was originally written here as prose. Prose is not a glob
# pattern, so it never ignored anything — it is preserved verbatim as a comment
# because the information is useful, and is documented properly in
# docs/architecture/environments-and-credentials.md.
#
#   AxiomCrmdb_Dev, AxiomCrmdb_QA, AxiomCrmdb_UAT, AxiomCrmdb_Prod
#   with db user : Axiom
#   password: Axiom@12345
#
# Rotate the production values and move them to a secret manager before any
# real production deployment.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
